import Mathlib

/-!
# Branch table of lane lean-m4log (generated by code/covering/log_branch.gp, PARI/GP)

An entry `⟨disc, c, s, wh, (a0, a1, a2), e⟩` of `branchTable k` is a box `{X : X ≡ c mod 2^s}` of the disc `disc` of
lane M4's covering (lean/FurioLombardo/M4/Data.lean, the constant boxes of `T_k.constant` then the tail boxes of
`T_k.tails`, in that order) with its branch: over the disc point `pKv disc X` the lift `x` of `D_δ(K_v)` with
`‖x.r - ρ‖ < ‖x.r + ρ‖` (`wh = true`) or `‖x.s - ρ‖ < ‖x.s + ρ‖` (`wh = false`), where
`ρ = (a0 + a1 pv + a2 pv²) / pv ^ e`. The reference root `ρ` is the root chosen by `liftP` of
code/earlier-computations/centres_cert.gp at the box centre `X = c` (`r = √(Q1/δ)` when `Q1(P(c))` is certified
nonzero and a square, else `s = √(Q3/δ)`), negated on the tail box of `x_2` (twist 0, disc 1, `Xi = 1`), whose branch has
`2 w0 = +t.g`. It is correct to `v_pv(ρ) + 30`: `v_pv(ρ_exact - ρ) ≥ v_pv(ρ) + 30`, with `a_i` reduced to `[0, 2^18)`.
-/

namespace FurioLombardo.Discharge.M4Log

/-- A box `(disc, c, s)` of lane M4's covering with its branch: `wh = true` fixes the lift by `r`,
`false` by `s`; the reference root is `(rho.1 + rho.2.1 pv + rho.2.2 pv²) / pv ^ e`. -/
structure BranchBox where
  disc : ℕ
  c : ℕ
  s : ℕ
  wh : Bool
  rho : ℤ × ℤ × ℤ
  e : ℕ
deriving DecidableEq

